    {
      "name": "Historial (versiones, diff, merge, créditos)",
      "description": "Project history (cambios.md §9). Run Cuentas (auth) > Sign up first so {{token}} is set. Order: fork c-001 as a new project, versions, diff, forks of c-001, merge preview, merge, credits.",
